        "PMC5494191::web::014::discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed bimodal microstructure will enhance the strength–plasticity combination of NbTaHfTiZrV0.5.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5494191::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC5494191::web::014::discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The starting NbTaHfTiZrV0.5 alloy has a uniform, fully recrystallized microstructure.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Approximately 50% room-temperature cold rolling will introduce stored strain.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5494191::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC5494191::web::011::discussion",
        "PMC5494191::web::014::discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "A shortened partial anneal will retain non-recrystallized grains while producing recrystallized regions.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5494191::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC5494191::web::014::discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Annealing NbTaHfTiZrV0.5 at 900–1000 °C for a shortened duration will achieve the desired partial recrystallization.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The resulting microstructure will comprise strain-hardened non-recrystallized grains coexisting with recrystallized regions.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5494191::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC5494191::web::014::discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stored strain in non-recrystallized NbTaHfTiZrV0.5 domains will promote deformation twinning during tensile deformation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5494191::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC5494191::web::011::discussion",
        "PMC5494191::web::014::discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Deformation twins will act as dynamic barriers to dislocation motion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Twin-mediated obstruction of dislocations will enhance strain hardening.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The combination of non-recrystallized regions and twinning will increase strength while retaining plasticity.",
